    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><strong>Features survival horror elements such as real threats, puzzles, and inventory management.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/edf5394ff9ac207b8e85e123bb97fb37.poster.avif?t=1715555136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/edf5394ff9ac207b8e85e123bb97fb37.webm?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/edf5394ff9ac207b8e85e123bb97fb37.mp4?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A three chapter story (all included) featuring 4 characters.<br></li><li>Realistic immersive art style.<br></li><li>Cinematic story telling.<br></li><li>Puzzle solving.<br></li><li>Terrifying monster.<br></li><li>Effective jumpscares.<br></li><li>Manual save system.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/9f50b1df9cfc095e2289e2a89c63954e.poster.avif?t=1715555136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/9f50b1df9cfc095e2289e2a89c63954e.webm?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/9f50b1df9cfc095e2289e2a89c63954e.mp4?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Average 1.25-2hr Playtime</u></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><strong>An old group of friends go camping in a Midwest forest believed to be inhabited by a cryptid named &quot;The Wolfman&quot;. As night falls, a nice reunion among friends turns bloody and Jane must fight to escape and save whatever friends she can to survive the full moon.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/cd4896d7e7ebd6432b41b79ac3d2ed4e.poster.avif?t=1715555136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/cd4896d7e7ebd6432b41b79ac3d2ed4e.webm?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/cd4896d7e7ebd6432b41b79ac3d2ed4e.mp4?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
