ong friends turns bloody and Jane must fight to escape and save whatever friends she can to survive the full moon.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/cd4896d7e7ebd6432b41b79ac3d2ed4e.poster.avif?t=1715555136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/cd4896d7e7ebd6432b41b79ac3d2ed4e.webm?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849730/extras/cd4896d7e7ebd6432b41b79ac3d2ed4e.mp4?t=1715555136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
